  "objective": {
    "subject": "test: cover cancellation attribution and exit-publication ordering",
    "body": "CancellationToken: the fail-fast cascade completes synchronously with the\ntriggering failure; caller-requested cancellation is attributed separately\nfrom timeout and fail-fast; direct cancel() is not caller attribution; the\ninjected domain timeout scheduler is observable; a losing transition inside\nthe winner's listener window does not cascade.\n\nTaskExecutionState: skipIfPending wins only once and never releases a\nclaimed slot; terminal publishes before the tracker exit listener runs;\nstate and status mirror each lifecycle phase.\n\nExecutionExitTracker: awaitBounded(0) does not consume an interrupt."
  },
